! Static Routing for Inter-Subnet Communication:
 ip route 192.168.1.28 255.255.255.252 192.168.1.25
 ip route 192.168.1.8 255.255.255.248 192.168.1.25
 ip route 192.168.1.0 255.255.255.248 192.168.1.34
